| 16px Regular | `.body-1` (default) |
| 16px Semibold | `.body-1-strong` |
| 14px Regular | `.body-2` |
| 14px Semibold | `.body-2-strong` |
| 14px Bold | `.body-2-stronger` |
| 12px Regular | `.caption-1` |
| 12px Semibold | `.caption-1-strong` |
| 12px Bold | `.caption-1-stronger` |
