## Spacing Scale

| Value | Token | Example classes |
|---|---|---|
| 2px | `xxs` | `gap-xxs`, `padding-xxs`, `margin-xxs` |
| 4px | `xs` | `gap-xs`, `padding-top-xs` |
| 8px | `sm` | `gap-sm`, `padding-sm` |
| 12px | `md` | `gap-md`, `margin-bottom-md` |
| 16px | `lg` | `gap-lg`, `padding-left-lg` |
| 24px | `xl` | `gap-xl`, `padding-xl` |
| 32px | `xxl` | `gap-xxl`, `margin-xxl` |
| 48px | `xxxl` | `padding-xxxl` |
| 56px | `xxxxl` | `padding-xxxxl` |

Class patterns: `gap-{size}`, `padding-{size}`, `padding-{direction}-{size}`, `margin-{size}`, `margin-{direction}-{size}`

SCSS usage: `map.get($spacing, "size")`

## Design System Component Registry

**Layout:** `Panel`, `Divider`, `InteractiveTile`, `ScrollingTextPanel`, `Modal`

**Controls:** `Button`, `Textbox`, `Number`, `SearchBox`, `Textarea`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `ToggleSwitch`, `Options`, `Range`

**Feedback:** `Loader`, `Progress`, `StatusCard`, `Badge`

**Container:** `Accordion` (wraps PrimeVue AccordionTab)

All located in `src/renderer/components/common/` and `src/renderer/components/controls/`.

## Allowed Exceptions

These are OK and should not be flagged:

- **Dynamic inline styles** computed from JS (e.g., `:style="{ width: computedWidth + 'px' }"`)
- **Showcase / demo styles** in `src/renderer/views/styles/` (one-off visual demos)
- **Genuinely unique values** not in the spacing scale, with a comment explaining why
- **`!important`** with a comment explaining the specificity issue
